# --- EL9110 (E-bus power supply feed terminal, bus position 8) ---
# No process data / HAL pins — just refreshes E-bus power for the terminals
# downstream of it in the chain. Not declared in ethercat-conf.xml at all
# (this lcec build doesn't recognize the type, and it has nothing to
# configure anyway) — no wiring needed here, no lcec.0.io-power.* pins exist.

