# --- EL4032 (2-ch analog output, spindle 0-10V — slave idx 14) ---
# Spindle speed wiring lives in ethercat.hal (net spindle-voltage-cmd), since
# it's driven by spindle.0.speed-out-abs rather than a plain machine I/O net.
# ao-1 is the terminal's second channel, unused here.
